<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Your Product Was Approved 🥳</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }

      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        background: #a9f334;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
        color: #333333;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      .highlight {
        background: #f7f7f7;
        border-left: 4px solid #a9f334;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 24px 0;
        color: #444;
      }

      .footer {
        background: #f7f7f7;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666666;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Your Product Was Approved</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi {{ sellerName }},</p>
        <p>Great news. Your product has been reviewed and approved by the admin team.</p>
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Your product is now eligible to appear in approved product listings.</strong>
        </div>
        <table class="details">
          <tr><td>Product name</td><td>{{ productName }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Price</td><td>{{ productPrice }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Description</td><td>{{ productDescription }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Category</td><td>{{ productCategory }}</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p>Best regards,<br />The DOJU Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        You are receiving this email because one of your products was approved on DOJU.
        <br /><br />
        (c) 2026 DOJU
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
